---
interface Props { source: 'public' | 'mls' }
const { source } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">{source === 'mls' ? 'AGENT SHOWING REQUEST · MLS ENTRY' : 'COME EXPERIENCE ROCKY BOTTOM'}</p><h1>A little closer<br />to <em>feeling at home.</em></h1><p>Plan a visit, ask a question, and keep every detail in one place.</p><a href="/viewings/status/">Already have a booking? View my bookings →</a></section>
<div class="portal-grid" id="intake" data-source={source}>
  <aside class="card journey"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR VISIT, STEP BY STEP</p><ol><li>Verify your email with an eight-digit code</li><li>Confirm your identity or agent credentials</li><li>Select a day and time</li><li>Review and confirm your request</li></ol><p>Returning visitors sign in with a fresh email code. No visitor password is needed.</p><a href="/viewings/?next=bookings">Sign in to my bookings →</a><p class="hint">The MLS entry route is not proof of agent identity.</p></aside>
  <section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">EXPLORE THE BOOKING FLOW</p><h2 id="intake-title">Start with your email.</h2><p>This preview uses visitor@example.com only. Sample bookings and availability are stored in this browser. No email is sent.</p>
    <form id="email-form"><label for="visitor-email">Email address (requires verification for bookings)<br /><span class="label-note">real-estate agents: use your business email address</span></label><input id="visitor-email" type="email" value="visitor@example.com" readonly /><button class="button" type="submit">Send sample verification code</button></form>
    <form id="code-form" hidden><p id="code-sent" role="status"></p><p class="inset" id="sample-code"></p><label for="email-code">Eight-digit verification code</label><input id="email-code" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="one-time-code" pattern="[0-9]{8}" maxlength="8" required /><div class="actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Verify email and continue</button><button class="text-button" type="button" id="resend-code">Resend code</button></div><p id="code-result" role="status"></p></form>
    <form id="intake-form" hidden><p class="badge">Sample email verified</p><label for="visitor-role">Are you a licensed real-estate agent?</label><select id="visitor-role"><option value="buyer" selected={source === 'public'}>No — I am a prospective buyer</option><option value="agent" selected={source === 'mls'}>Yes — I am a licensed agent</option></select>
      <fieldset id="agent-fields" hidden={source !== 'mls'}><legend>Agent profile · fictional example</legend><label for="agent-name">Licensed name</label><input id="agent-name" value="Sample Agent" readonly /><div class="field-pair"><div><label for="license-state">Issuing state</label><input id="license-state" value="South Carolina" readonly /></div><div><label for="license-number">License number</label><input id="license-number" value="SAMPLE — NOT A LICENSE" readonly /></div></div><label for="brokerage">Brokerage</label><input id="brokerage" value="Example brokerage" readonly /><p class="hint">We use your registration email as your business email and check its association with your license and brokerage independently.</p></fieldset>
      <div class="inset" id="verification-explanation"></div><button class="button" type="submit">Continue with sample verification →</button></form>
    <section id="slot-step" hidden><p class="badge" id="verification-badge"></p><h2>Find a time to visit.</h2><p>Sample availability · Eastern Time. One-hour slots, 9 AM–5 PM, are illustrative defaults.</p><h3 id="calendar-heading">Rolling weekly availability</h3><p class="hint">Each row runs Sunday–Saturday, beginning with this week. Four weeks are shown Sunday–Wednesday; five Thursday–Saturday.</p><p id="calendar-range"></p><div class="calendar-grid" id="visitor-calendar" role="group" aria-label="Available viewing days"></div><h3 id="selected-day">Select a day to see times</h3><div class="slot-tiles" id="slot-list" role="group" aria-label="Sample viewing times"></div><p class="hint" id="slot-empty"></p><label class="check" id="attending-wrap" hidden><input id="agent-attending" type="checkbox" /> I will attend and will not share access for an unaccompanied buyer visit.</label><button class="button" id="request-sample" type="button" disabled>Review viewing request</button><section id="booking-review" class="inset" hidden><h3>Review your visit</h3><p id="review-summary"></p><button class="button" id="confirm-booking" type="button">Confirm sample booking request</button></section><p class="status" id="request-result" role="status" tabindex="-1"></p><a id="manage-bookings" href="/viewings/status" hidden>View my sample bookings →</a><button class="text-button" id="restart" type="button">← Change sample profile</button></section>
  </section>
</div>
<script>import '../scripts/viewing-intake';</script>
